> <a href=\"/wiki/Champion_of_Champions\" title=\"Champion of Champions\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">1</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Champion_of_Champions_2\" title=\"Champion of Champions 2\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">2</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Champion_of_Champions_3\" title=\"Champion of Champions 3\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">3</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Champion_of_Champions_4\" title=\"Champion of Champions 4\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">4</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Champion_of_Champions_5\" title=\"Champion of Champions 5\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">5</span></a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\"><small>New Year Treat:</small> <a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster%27s_New_Year_Treat#New_Year_Treat_1\" title=\"Taskmaster&#39;s New Year Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">1</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster%27s_New_Year_Treat#New_Year_Treat_2\" title=\"Taskmaster&#39;s New Year Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">2</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster%27s_New_Year_Treat#New_Year_Treat_3\" title=\"Taskmaster&#39;s New Year Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">3</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster%27s_New_Year_Treat#New_Year_Treat_4\" title=\"Taskmaster&#39;s New Year Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">4</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster%27s_New_Year_Treat#New_Year_Treat_5\" title=\"Taskmaster&#39;s New Year Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">5</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster%27s_New_Year_Treat#New_Year_Treat_6\" title=\"Taskmaster&#39;s New Year Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">6</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster%27s_New_Year_Treat#New_Year_Treat_7\" title=\"Taskmaster&#39;s New Year Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">7</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster%27s_New_Year_Treat#New_Year_Treat_8\" title=\"Taskmaster&#39;s New Year Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">8</span></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"font-family: &#39;Veteran Typewriter&#39;\">\n<td align=\"center\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sometimes_spit.\" title=\"Sometimes spit.\">Sometimes spit.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/An_invisible_jump_rope.\" title=\"An invisible jump rope.\">An invisible jump rope.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/My_presumably_scrotum.\" title=\"My presumably scrotum.\">My presumably scrotum.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Midnight_picnic.\" title=\"Midnight picnic.\">Midnight picnic.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Maybe we're the monsters.</strong></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/It%27s_got_to_be_obsolete.\" title=\"It&#39;s got to be obsolete.\">It's got to be obsolete.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Glass_half_most.\" title=\"Glass half most.\">Glass half most.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Science_all_your_life.\" title=\"Science all your life.\">Science all your life.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Getaway_sticks.\" title=\"Getaway sticks.\">Getaway sticks.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_clever_side%3F\" title=\"The clever side?\">The clever side?</a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Maybe we're the monsters.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/2/2e/Maybe_we%27re_the_monsters..png/revision/latest?cb=20250529215730\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Maybe we&#39;re the monsters.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/2/2e/Maybe_we%27re_the_monsters..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20250529215730\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/2/2e/Maybe_we%27re_the_monsters..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20250529215730 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/2/2e/Maybe_we%27re_the_monsters..png/revision/latest?cb=20250529215730 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Maybe we&#39;re the monsters.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Maybe_we%27re_the_monsters..png\" data-image-name=\"Maybe we&#39;re the monsters..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_19\" title=\"Series 19\">19</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">5</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jason_Mantzoukas\" title=\"Jason Mantzoukas\">Jason Mantzoukas</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Midnight_picnic.\" title=\"Midnight picnic.\">Midnight picnic.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/It%27s_got_to_be_obsolete.\" title=\"It&#39;s got to be obsolete.\">It's got to be obsolete.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Maybe we're the monsters.</b></i> is the fifth episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_19\" title=\"Series 19\">Series 19</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_4\" title=\"Channel 4\">Channel 4</a> on 29 May 2025. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Jason_Mantzoukas\" title=\"Jason Mantzoukas\">Jason Mantzoukas</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_Title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode Title</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trivia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_Title\">Episode Title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode Title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Maybe_we%27re_the_monsters.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode Title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2><p>\nBoth the episode title and title card reference the <a href=\"/wiki/Draw_the_monster\" title=\"Draw the monster\">Draw the monster</a> task. <a href=\"/wiki/Greg_Davies\" title=\"Greg Davies\">Greg Davies</a> suggests that \"Maybe we're the monsters...\" during his end of episode sign-off, referencing <a href=\"/wiki/Rosie_Ramsey\" title=\"Rosie Ramsey\">Rosie Ramsey</a>’s mistaken belief that they were intended to be playing the role of the monster (as the monster's profile appears on their driver's license).</p><div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Maybe_we%27re_the_monsters.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table align=\"center\" style=\"line-height: 1;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td rowspan=\"3\" style=\"vertical-align: top; font-family: &#39;Veteran Typewriter&#39;, monospace; font-size: 40px; font-weight: bold; text-align: left; padding: 0 5px 5px 5px;\">&#8220;\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle; line-height: 1.5;\"><i>The five comics vying to win <a href=\"/wiki/Greg_Davies\" title=\"Greg Davies\">Greg Davies</a>' golden head experience some moments of real discovery, as <a href=\"/wiki/Rosie_Ramsey\" title=\"Rosie Ramsey\">Rosie Ramsey</a> has a revelation about monster identity, <a href=\"/wiki/Stevie_Martin\" title=\"Stevie Martin\">Stevie Martin</a> finds a new use for her nail varnish and <a href=\"/wiki/Jason_Mantzoukas\" title=\"Jason Mantzoukas\">Jason Mantzoukas</a> learns that lollipop ladies exist. <a href=\"/wiki/Alex_Horne\" title=\"Alex Horne\">Alex Horne</a> gets comfy by a campfire to hear <a href=\"/wiki/Fatiha_El-Ghorri\" title=\"Fatiha El-Ghorri\">Fatiha El-Ghorri</a> tell a disturbing story about a goat, before he's compelled to join in with <a href=\"/wiki/Mathew_Baynton\" title=\"Mathew Baynton\">Mathew Baynton</a>'s ode to storage.</i>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: bottom; font-family: &#39;Veteran Typewriter&#39;, monospace; font-size: 40px; font-weight: bold; text-align: left; padding: 5px 5px -3px 5px;\">&#8221;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: right;\">- British Comedy Guide\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><small><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"https://www.comedy.co.uk/tv/taskmaster/episodes/19/5/\">[1]</a></small>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Fatiha_El-Ghorri\" title=\"Fatiha El-Ghorri\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Fatiha El-Ghorri</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Jason_Mantzoukas\" title=\"Jason Mantzoukas\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Jason Mantzoukas</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Mathew_Baynton\" title=\"Mathew Baynton\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Mathew Baynton</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Rosie_Ramsey\" title=\"Rosie Ramsey\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Rosie Ramsey</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Stevie_Martin\" title=\"Stevie Martin\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Stevie Martin</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Best_object_to_bestow_in_your_will_to_a_relative_against_whom_you_are_seeking_revenge\" title=\"Best object to bestow in your will to a relative against whom you are seeking revenge\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Best object to bestow in your will to a relative against whom you are seeking revenge.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Be_the_least_annoying_person_round_the_campfire\" title=\"Be the least annoying person round the campfire\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Be the least annoying person round the campfire. You must either sing a folk song, tell a ghost story or recite a beat poem and not be annoying. Your song, story or poem must either be about fast cars, barbecues or DIY and it can contain no more than 100 words.\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Draw_the_monster\" title=\"Draw the monster\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Draw the monster. You must not turn around or leave the car. If you fail to honk your horn when you see a lollipop lady, you must surrender your picture for 30 seconds.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Write_down_every_word_you_said_in_this_room_before_you_opened_this_task\" title=\"Write down every word you said in this room before you opened this task\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Shorten these pencils and place your shortened pencils in the pencil case.\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">4\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">3\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">1\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td>Write down every word you said in this room before you opened this task. Also, you must write the same number of words in each colour, otherwise your total will be halved. You must not leave the lab.\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Pop_a_balloon_when_you_hear_its_colour\" title=\"Pop a balloon when you hear its colour\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Pop a balloon when you hear its colour. Last to pop is eliminated. If you pop early, you are eliminated.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Make_as_many_holes_in_this_sheet_of_paper_as_possible\" title=\"Make as many holes in this sheet of paper as possible\">T</a>\n</td>\n<td>Make as many holes in this sheet of paper as possible. You may only use the hole punch once.\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td>\n<td><b>✔</b>\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td>\n<td>✘\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>11\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">17\n</td>\n<td>14\n</td>\n<td>17\n</td>\n<td>14\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Trivia\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Maybe_we%27re_the_monsters.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Trivia\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>This is the first episode in the UK show to have its episode title be a quote from <a href=\"/wiki/Greg_Davies\" title=\"Greg Davies\">Greg Davies</a>' \"what have we learned today?\" at the end. It is the second episode to have the quote come from after the live task after <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Having_a_little_chuckle.\" title=\"Having a little chuckle.\">Having a little chuckle.</a></span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Jason_Mantzoukas\" title=\"Jason Mantzoukas\">Jason Mantzoukas</a>' on-stage celebration was shown without text overlayed in full on the official <i>Taskmaster</i> YouTube channel.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Mayb